	(text "SPI ROUTING: final impedances/skew are pending stackup and receiver data.\nR41/R42 are provisional damping; verify all multidrop endpoints.\nPlace ESD devices at connectors with short ground returns.\nF4 -> J10, F5 -> J11, F6 -> J12: independent PTC output rails.\nMF-MSMF075: each holds 0.55 A at 50C; NOT a combined available budget.\nShared U1/source limits still apply; fault selectivity is not guaranteed.\nShared I2C signals remain vulnerable to any device holding a bus line low."
		(at 260.35 300.99 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "031a2600-3ef1-4f16-973e-c2be2b942fe8")
	)
