	)
	(text "J14 CONTROLBOARD INTERFACE ONLY (remote board not audited):\n1/2 +3V3; 3/5/7/9/11/15/MP GND; 4 SCK; 6 MOSI; 8 MISO;\n10 CS; 12 HANDSHAKE; 13 DATA_READY; 14 RESET.\nConfirm cable/mating pinout and remote I/O limits before connection.\nConfigure reset open-drain only if the remote EN pull-up is present.\nR75/R76 = 100k: bias when disconnected, not guaranteed reset-state logic.\nESP32-C5 MTCK/GPIO4 has a reset pull-up; receiver level must be checked.\nProtocol speed/mode and interrupt masking are firmware requirements."
		(at 151.13 302.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "73d5c75f-dc2f-48cc-bbba-1f366af59d4b")
	)
